ver_01_strike_framed.png", "id": "1311975330958623", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830822_1311975334291956_7896831830571407322_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x5PYUcOghqcQ7kNvwF41u7V&_nc_oc=AdrHKUiBfw8dHWFjeR2ucgsNrm6V6OY-qC-PJxqlnX0yshnALoKPlpiqlE163p5OS8w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQJXnxbTavNBr3uMF4D_icQy3fondsxtecwbKMm-tnbBQ&oe=6AFC682F"}, "display_name": "Pro Catcher VR Trainer", "keywords": ["catcher", "baseball", "softball", "framing", "blocking"], "long_description": "Level up your receiving, framing and blocking.\n\nPro Catcher VR Trainer puts you in your crouch behind home plate with a pitcher working to you at game distance, a batter in the box, an umpire behind you and a runner on first. Every pitch is called, and the moment it's over you get a technique breakdown: what you did right, what cost you the strike, and what to fix next.\n\n\u2022 Frame borderline pitches well and the umpire gives you the strike.\n\u2022 Block balls in the dirt: let one get by and the runner moves up. A run costs you 20 points.\n\u2022 Up to 10 technique checks per pitch, from the real movement of your head, mitt and hand.\n\u2022 Instant replay from four angles with slow motion.\n\u2022 Pro Ghost: a green ghost catcher replays the pitch the right way, right beside you.\n\u2022 Baseball at 60 ft 6 in with 7 pitch types, fastpitch softball at 43 ft with 6. Fastballs from 45 to 95 mph.\n\u2022 Make it yours: youth, normal or large mitt in brown or black leather, mitt guide labels, two stadiums, music and voice calls.\n\u2022 Catch your way: squeeze the trigger, let the pocket hold it, or go Full auto.\n\u2022 Set difficulty, dirt-ball share, pitch types and pitcher and batter handedness.\n\nFor baseball and fastpitch softball catchers from youth to college, and their coaches.\n\nRequires Meta Quest 2 or newer with Touch controllers. Play standing in a cleared space; you'll crouch, shift and drop to your knees, so a soft mat or knee pads help. No artificial locomotion.", "short_description": "Receive, frame and block live pitching from behind the plate, get a technique breakdown after every pitch, and watch it back with the Pro Ghost showing the ideal rep beside you. For baseball and fastpitch softball catchers. Great for youth catchers just getting started and want to improve their framing and blocking - or maybe they are a little hesitant to get in the block position. Also great for those with 10+ years of experience that want to get some extra reps with visual feedback."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://360motionlabs.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.360motionlabs.com/terms", "publisher_name": "360 Motion Labs LLC", "support_website_url": "https://360motionlabs.com/support", "website_url": "https://360motionlabs.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1337809922754785"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1682804773359702"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1481006433915905"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1481006433915905"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1793559600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1682804773359702"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_b